WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.389
The zodiac.

00:02.089 --> 00:06.723
The dashed line is the path the Sun takes across the stars in a year.

00:07.173 --> 00:13.315
The Moon and the planets never stray far from it, because the Solar System is nearly flat.

00:13.765 --> 00:16.406
The figures along it are the zodiac.

00:16.856 --> 00:26.341
Babylonian sky watchers counted twelve; the line really crosses thirteen, and the one left out is here: Ophiuchus, the serpent bearer.
